# Todo list: TaskCreate/TaskUpdate items and the ctrl+t toggle.
name: todos
size: 100x30
args: --permission-mode default
prompt: Make a todo list for the rename
files: ../../../testdata/fixtures/12/app
script: scripts/todos.json
env: CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TODO_TOOLS=1
parity: TR-16, CH-10
---
ready
wait_for 30s Todo list ready.
settle
checkpoint todos
keys ctrl+t
settle
checkpoint toggled
